'''The Dryrock Pit''' is a slave labor camp ran by [[Overlord Grigor]] and [[High Officer Osmark|High Officer Osmark Dryrock]] located within the [[Dryrock Valley]] in western [[Gilneas]]. Lord [[Isiden Perenolde]] of [[Alterac (kingdom)|Alterac]], guest of House Greymane and claimant to the throne of Alterac, was formerly held here by order of the Regent-Lords Harlow before his escape at some point after the [[Ravenwood Rebellion]] cracked open the [[Greymane Wall]].<ref>[[Dossier: Isiden Perenolde]]</ref>

